                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 8,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As a doctor, I've seen firsthand what happens when people lose access to health care.\n\nPatients skip checkups and go without medications. Chronic conditions worsen, small problems turn into major health crises, and preventable illnesses become emergencies.\n\nIf Republicans refuse to extend Affordable Care Act subsidies, more Americans will face this unacceptable reality.\n\nThat's why I'm fighting to extend these subsidies and protect access to affordable health care.",
