                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 9,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "President Trump backed out of a meeting with Democratic leadership. \n\nThe deadline to fund the government is just four days away. \n\nIt is time for President Trump to make a deal with Democrats to protect Americans\u2019 health care and keep the government open.",
