                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "24 million Americans \u2014 including 28,000 right here in our district \u2014 would see their health care premiums skyrocket if Republicans let Affordable Care Act subsidies expire.\n\nI\u2019m fighting to extend these subsidies to protect access to affordable, quality health care for Sacramento County families.",
