                "quoted_status_profile_username": "HouseDailyPress",
                "reply_count": 7,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We cannot let this shutdown continue.\n\nSpeaker Johnson must bring us back to protect affordable health care for more than 20 million Americans and reopen the government to serve the American people.",
