                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "We are now in Day 8 of the federal government shutdown.\n\nOur troops will miss a paycheck if we do not reopen the government by October 13th.\n\nSpeaker Johnson must bring lawmakers back to negotiate a bipartisan agreement to reopen the government, protect affordable health care, and ensure our troops get paid on time.",
