                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "No one wins a government shutdown.\n\nIt\u2019s the American people who lose.\n\nSpeaker Johnson needs to call us back to D.C. to negotiate a deal that protects affordable health care and reopens the government to serve the American people.",
