                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Durable health care reforms take time and bipartisan cooperation.\n\nI\u2019m ready to do that work.\n\nBut first, we must prevent imminent premium hikes for more than 20 million Americans by extending Affordable Care Act subsidies.\n\nThen we can pursue long-term solutions that put patients first, increase transparency, and bring down costs.",
